Z||000017||mrfixit58||11-20-2001||11:19 PM||||Thanks guys. A few more details on the car... First off, the t-top components are in remarkable shape. The corner trim pieces are almost perfect as is the weather stripping and mechanisms. Unfortunately, the keys for the t-top locks are missing. I'll remove one of the tops and have one made. The interior is in great shape. There is very little buckling and what little there is can easily be repaired. The seat covers are perfect except for 14 years of grime. The car has NEVER even been smoked in. Remarkable. Anyway, on to some questions:<P>"I noticed that the yellow on the nose seems a little faded. Is that from the picture or is the car really like that? "<P>Actually, the hood has been re painted. Most likely the clear coat gave out with the previous owner.<P>"What's the CJB code mean, the factory t-tops? "<P>That's correct. There were only a little over 600 GTs ordered from the factory with the t-top option. In all, a little over 1200 Fieros total came "officially" from Pontiac with the T-top.<P>"You rich, lucky bastard! Must be nice  Sweet car man! Any plans for it? "<P>Rich? not hardly.. Lucky, yes. Sweet, thanks. Plans... fix a few odds and ends and enjoy it. <P><BR>Thanks again,<BR>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||7
Z||000018||My7Fieros||11-20-2001||11:22 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by avengador1:<BR><B>Awesome T-top, but I noticed that the yellow on the nose seems a little faded. Is that from the picture or is the car really like that? Anyway that is a beautifull car.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Actually it looks more like the hood has been repainted..looks a bit brighter than the rest...may just be the pic though.<BR>VERY NICE CAR!!!!!!!! Its good to see it went to a Fiero enthusiast! Great find...congrats!<BR><B>edit</B>...mrfixit replied the same time I was and made mention of the hood.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My7logo_1.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 11-20-2001).]||||reg||1
